  "description": "A young boy admirer of his planet’s greatest heroine gets a chance to take on her form when his heroine suffers an accident breaking her body up into pieces.\n\nSapana has grown up admiring her childhood heroine, Heroina, who saved him when he was just a child. One day, Heroina, who has been protecting the planet for what seems like a long time, suddenly leaves it saying, “This place has become peaceful. It is time to help other planets as well.” Upon learning this, Sapana is shocked, but soon does the craziest thing imaginable and stops away on a a spaceship to meet Heroina.\n\nSapana’s spacecraft, on it’s way to the point where Heroina has gone, is struck by a meteorite and crash lands on a little blue planet called Earth. So in order to keep her identity a secret, he finds employ, jet at a construction site in order to make enough money to fix his ship. While working, Sapana finds a piece of bright meteorite that breaks in his hand and he accidentally absorbs the light, a small fragment of Heroina‘s power. Now, with this new found power, Sapana realizes he can actually change into Heroina’s appearance, but even more so, other people can absorb other fragments and do mischievous things with them, and even worse still; Heroina is actually inside these fragments and Sapana must find them all to put his heroine back together again.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=4364930), [KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/54296895)",
